Package: MetaEngine
Title: Post-Acquisition Metabolomics Annotation and Analysis
Version: 0.6.0.9000
Authors@R: person("MetaEngine", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Modular post-acquisition metabolomics analysis including accurate-mass
    candidate generation, adduct hypotheses, MS-DIAL evidence import, and
    exploratory differential statistics and pathway analysis. Identification
    confidence is evidence-dependent and mass-only candidates remain tentative.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: stats, utils, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), limma, preprocessCore, readxl, xml2, igraph, data.table, dplyr, ggplot2, BiocManager, variancePartition
Config/testthat/edition: 3
